## What We Provide vs. What You Bring

A virtual or hybrid event is really two things: the call itself, and the room the in-person audience sits in. We supply the second one.

**We provide**: PA sound systems and microphones so your in-room audience can hear, a projector and screen or LED display so they can see the call, and the adapters to plug your laptop into both. On our larger packages, a technician stays on site to run it.

**You bring**: your own laptop or device, your streaming or video conferencing software (Zoom, Teams, or whatever your event runs on), and your own internet connection. We do not supply cameras, streaming encoders, or a recording service.

Being clear about that split up front means no surprises on the day.

