## Connecting Your Own Laptop

Our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes all the adapters you need, HDMI and USB-C, plus audio interfaces, to connect your own laptop, tablet or media player to our sound and screen setup seamlessly. For a larger conference room, our [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) offers a bigger 60 inch LED display and a dedicated technician for up to six hours; ask when you book if you need the same laptop adapters on that setup.

Running an in-person training day instead of a remote or hybrid one? See our [audio visual rental for training sessions](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-training-sessions/) guide.

